  /**
   * ### Description
   * Cards are rectangular containers that can be used to display content about a single subject.
   * They are easy to scan for information and visually distinguish their content from other elements on the screen.
   * One common usecase for cards are options in a list.
   *
   * ### Card Content
   * This `Card` component has several subcomponents
   * that can be used to display content inside it:
   * - {@link CardImage `Card.Image`}
   * - {@link CardBody `Card.Body`}
   * - {@link CardTitle `Card.Title`}
   * - {@link CardSubtitle `Card.Subtitle`}
   *
   * #### Example
