          size='sm'
          edgeToEdge
      />
      <Card.Body>
          <Card.Title size='sm'> Auburn Waves </Card.Title>
          <Card.Subtitle size='sm'> Janice Zagler </Card.Subtitle>
      </Card.Body>
  </Card>
   * ```
   * When using these sub-components it is helpful to use a common `size` to ensure proper spacing
   * of the content. You can also use your own custom content by passing child components inside `Card`
   *
   * ### Focus Management
   * `Card` is a focusable element. By default when the `Card` is focused, a white border will appear
   * on the `Card`. When `Card` isn't focused there is a small space (implemented via. margin)
   * that is the same size of the border it has when focused. This prevents unneccessary layout changes
